Redirect 301 /white-label-wordpress-development https://pixelstreet.in
# Five of these case studies no longer exist as pages. They were redirecting
# /case-study/<slug> to /case-studies/<slug>, which then 404'd — a 301 into a
# dead end, which is worse for a crawler than a plain 404 because it looks like
# a working move. They now land on /our-work, the case-study index, which is the
# closest surviving equivalent. Precedent: /case-studies/dazzle already redirects
# to the site root for the same reason.
# The FAQ page was retired on 8 Aug 2026. /contact-us is the closest surviving
# intent — someone with a question wants an answer — which is what keeps a 301
# from being read as a soft 404. The service pages carry their own FAQs.
Redirect 301 /faq https://pixelstreet.in/contact-us

Redirect 301 /case-study/shanghai https://pixelstreet.in/our-work
Redirect 301 /case-study/mangaldeep-3in1 https://pixelstreet.in/case-studies/mangaldeep-3in1
